OL,3,GNEWSAFire-hit moorland added to
OL,4,Aheritage risk register
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of the North York Moors landscape
OL,7,Fhave been added to Historic England's
OL,8,FHeritage at Risk Register, after a
OL,9,Fwildfire caused extensive damage.
OL,11,FThe blaze burned across about seven sq
OL,12,Fmiles (18 sq km), of Fylingdales Moor
OL,13,Fin 2025, damaging peatland habitats,
OL,14,Fmore than 20 scheduled monuments and
OL,15,Fsix listed buildings.
OL,17,FHistoric England and the North York
OL,18,FMoors National Park Authority (NYMNPA),
OL,19,Fare using drone technology to assess
OL,20,Fthe impact.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
